      "review_summary": "The branch exposes `timeoutMs` through the shared web-media loader and sets 120-second total request deadlines on three agent-tool and two Tlon remote-media fetch paths.\n\nPR surface: Source +33. Total +33 across 7 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level with high confidence: current callers only bound body-idle time, so a server that never returns headers has no caller-supplied overall deadline; the branch's unchanged exact Tlon assertions also provide deterministic focused-test failures. A real caller-level stalled-server run was not supplied.",
